</div><div class=\"wj-entry\"><div class=\"wj-date\">Wed 16 Sep 2026</div></div></div><div class=\"wj-card\"><h2>Supremacy Not Only Intense</h2><div class=\"wj-maker\">Afnan</div><div class=\"wj-obs\"><span class=\"wj-badge\">1 wear</span><span class=\"wj-badge\">crowd 4.4</span></div><div class=\"wj-entry\"><div class=\"wj-date\">Fri 11 Sep 2026</div></div></div><div class=\"wj-card\"><h2>L&#x27;Air du Désert Marocain</h2><div class=\"wj-maker\">Tauer Perfumes</div><div class=\"wj-obs\"><span class=\"wj-badge\">1 wear</span><span class=\"wj-badge\">crowd 4.7</span></div><div class=\"wj-entry\"><div class=\"wj-date\">Thu 10 Sep 2026</div></div></div><div class=\"wj-card\"><h2>Encre Noire</h2><div class=\"wj-maker\">Lalique</div><div class=\"wj-obs\"><span class=\"wj-badge\">1 wear</span><span class=\"wj-badge\">crowd 4.5</span></div><div class=\"wj-entry\"><div class=\"wj-date\">Thu 03 Sep 2026</div></div></div><div class=\"wj-card\"><h2>Strike Black</h2><div class=\"wj-maker\">Assaf</div><div class=\"wj-obs\"><span class=\"wj-badge\">1 wear</span><span class=\"wj-badge\">crowd 4.2</span></div><div class=\"wj-entry\"><div class=\"wj-date\">Wed 02 Sep 2026</div></div></div><div class=\"wj-card\"><h2>Shaheen Silver</h2><div class=\"wj-maker\">Lattafa</div><div class=\"wj-obs\"><span class=\"wj-badge\">1 wear</span><span class=\"wj-badge\">crowd 4.2</span></div><div class=\"wj-entry\"><div class=\"wj-date\">Sun 30 Aug 2026</div></div></div></div>\n"
